senses.gloss:
(1) BOERHAAVIA REPENS LINN. (Chopra; Dgm, p. 210; DWH 3, p.
130-132; Gul; HK; IRM 1, p. 199; Nadk. 1, nr. 363; PA 1, 5, p. 9-26;
Sanyal) = B. DIFFUSA LINN. (Ainslie 2, p. 205-207; Avk; Bpn, p. 421:
श्वेतपुनर्नवा; Chopra; Dgv, nr. 258; Dutt; Dy, p. 655-656; HB;
HK; IRM 1, p. 199; Kav; KB 3, p. 2045-2048; Nadk 1, nr. 363;
PA 1, 5, p. 9-26; V 6, p. 125; Vśs; Wise) [= B. PROCUMBENS ROXB.]
(KB 3, p. 2045-2048; Nadk. 1, nr. 363; PA 1, 5, p. 9-26; Roxb., p. 49)
[= B. ERECTA BANKS EX ROXB.] (HK); unclear are:
a) B. PROCUMBENS, mentioned by Dutt, Nadk. (1, nr. 363) and Vśs,
which may be the plant designated as B. PROCUMBENS ROXB. by
some authors, or another species: B. PROCUMBENS BANKS EX ROXB.;
b) B. ERECTA, mentioned by Dutt, Nadk. (1, nr. 363) and Vśs, which
may be B. ERECTA ELL., a synonym of B. REPENS LINN., or a differ-
ent species: B. ERECTA LINN. = B. DIANDRA BURM. F.;
[]
c) B. DIANDRA, mentioned by Vśs, which may be B. DIANDRA LINN. =
B. HIRSUTA LINN., or B. DIANDRA BURM. F. (see b);
(2) B. VERTICILLATA POIR. (Dgm, p. 210) = B. REPANDA ROXB.
(Ainslie 2, p. 207);
(3) B. REPANDA WILLD. (PA 1, 5, p. 9-26);
(4) B. ALATA (Wise); the Index Kewensis records only B. ALATA S.
WATS., an American species;
(5) B. PROCUMBENS BANKS EX ROXB. (HK?);
(6) TRIANTHEMA PORTULACASTRUM LINN. (Bpn, p. 421: रक्तपुनर्-
नवा; Chopra: पुनर्नवी; KB 2, p. 1180-1181: श्वेतपुनर्नवा; PA
1, 5, p. 9-26) = T. MONOGYNA LINN. (Chopra: पुनर्नवी; Dgm, p.
210; DWH 2, p. 102-103: श्वेतपुनर्नवा; Ghosh: श्वेतपुनर्नवा;
KB 2, p. 1180-1181; Nadk. 1, nr. 2491; PA 1, 5, p. 9-26; Sanyal) =
T. OBCORDATA ROXB. (Nadk. 1, nr. 2491; PA 1, 5, p. 9-26);
(7) T. PENTANDRA LINN. (Nadk. 1, nr. 2491) = T. OBCORDATA WALL.;
(8) T. DECANDRA LINN. (Chopra: पुनर्नवी; Dgm, p. 210; KB 2,
p. 1182: पुनर्नवी; PA 1, 5, p. 9-26);
(9) T. CRYSTALLINA VAHL (Dgm, p. 210).

(1) CALOPHYLLUM INOPHYLLUM LINN. (Dgv, nr. 40; Dgm, p. 235-236;
Dutt; DWH 1, p. 173-176; HK; IRM 2, p. 18-19; KB 1, p. 270-271;
MW; Na 1, nr. 45; Nadk. 1, nr. 425; V 6, p. 124; Vśs);
(2) C. TOMENTOSUM WIGHT (Dgm, p. 235-236);
(3) C. WIGHTIANUM WALL. (Dgm, p. 235-236);
(4) C. APETALUM WILLD. (Dgm, p. 235-236) = C. INOPHYLLUM?;
(5) OCHROCARPUS LONGIFOLIUS BENTH. ET HOOK. F. EX T. ANDERS.
(DWH 1, p. 172-173; KB 1, p. 269-270; Nadk. 1, nr. 731);
(6) [CALLITRIS INOPHYLLUM LINN.] (Nadk. 1, nr. 422);
(7) MALLOTUS PHILIPPINENSIS MUELL. ARG. (KB 3, p. 2267-2270) =
ROTTLERA TINCTORIA ROXB. (KB 3, p. 2267; MW; PW; Roxb., p. 737);
(8) nutmeg, i. e. the seed of MYRISTICA FRAGRANS HOUTT. (जातीफल)
(MW; PW; Vśs);
(9) white lotus (MW; PW; Vśs: श्वेतपद्म).
